{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1474","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. 1 2 3 4 ..."}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Igor had a sequence $$$d_1, d_2, \\dots, d_n$$$ of integers. When Igor entered the classroom there was an integer $$$x$$$ written on the blackboard."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Igor generated sequence $$$p$$$ using the following algorithm: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" initially, $$$p = [x]$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" for each $$$1 \\leq i \\leq n$$$ he did the following operation $$$|d_i|$$$ times: "},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"kind":"list"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" if $$$d_i \\geq 0$$$, then he looked at the last element of $$$p$$$ (let it be $$$y$$$) and appended $$$y + 1$$$ to the end of $$$p$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" if $$$d_i \\lt 0$$$, then he looked at the last element of $$$p$$$ (let it be $$$y$$$) and appended $$$y - 1$$$ to the end of $$$p$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, if $$$x = 3$$$, and $$$d = [1, -1, 2]$$$, $$$p$$$ will be equal $$$[3, 4, 3, 4, 5]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Igor decided to calculate the length of the longest increasing subsequence of $$$p$$$ and the number of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A sequence $$$a$$$ is a subsequence of a sequence $$$b$$$ if $$$a$$$ can be obtained from $$$b$$$ by deletion of several (possibly, zero or all) elements."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A sequence $$$a$$$ is an increasing sequence if each element of $$$a$$$ (except the first one) is strictly greater than the previous element."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For $$$p = [3, 4, 3, 4, 5]$$$, the length of longest increasing subsequence is $$$3$$$ and there are $$$3$$$ of them: $$$[\\underline{3}, \\underline{4}, 3, 4, \\underline{5}]$$$, $$$[\\underline{3}, 4, 3, \\underline{4}, \\underline{5}]$$$, $$$[3, 4, \\underline{3}, \\underline{4}, \\underline{5}]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq 50$$$) — the length of the sequence $$$d$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains a single integer $$$x$$$ ($$$-10^9 \\leq x \\leq 10^9$$$) — the integer on the blackboard."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$d_1, d_2, \\ldots, d_n$$$ ($$$-10^9 \\leq d_i \\leq 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print two integers: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the first integer should be equal to the length of the longest increasing subsequence of $$$p$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the second should be equal to the number of them modulo $$$998244353$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You should print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"only the second number"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" modulo $$$998244353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n3\n1 -1 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n100\n5 -3 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n9 7\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n1\n999999999 0 1000000000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2000000000 1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n34\n1337 -146 42 -69 228\n